description:
Design a circuit that implements a four-variable Karnaugh map for optimizing Boolean expressions. The module takes four inputs (A, B, C, D) and computes the output F based on the values of these inputs, effectively determining Boolean function outcomes based on specific combinations of A and B while utilizing the values of C and D for further logic evaluations. This allows for simplified representation and implementation of the Boolean logic within combinational logic circuits.
